          "_name": "list03",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list03\" group=\"List\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"9\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Main Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Main Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>NEWS &amp; INSIGHTS</b></h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n        </h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-left item features-without-image mt-0 mb-5 active\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>August 2025 — New Employment Act Updates</b></h5>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}} item-wrapper\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Our legal team shares key updates to Malaysia’s Employment Act and what employers should prepare for.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-left item features-without-image mt-0 mb-5\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>June 2025 — Lex &amp;amp; Partners Wins Property Case</b></h5>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}} item-wrapper\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">We successfully represented our client in a high-profile land dispute, reinforcing our firm’s reputation in real estate law.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-left item features-without-image mt-0 mb-5\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>April 2025 — Free Legal Talk for Startups</b></h5>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}} item-wrapper\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Join our upcoming seminar on “Legal Basics for Startups.” Registration is open to entrepreneurs and<br>business owners.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>",
